        "is_free": false,
        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bunny's Bodacious Buffet Bonanza is a local two-player arcade game designed with the Steam Deck in mind. The game also supports two players on the same keyboard, a shared controller, multiple controllers, and also Remote Play Together. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005810/extras/c8f43e4e4a45541b03b17d128dc32372.avif?t=1782324932\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005810/extras_big/c8f43e4e4a45541b03b17d128dc32372.webp?t=1782324932 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The objective is simple enough for all ages: kick more veggies to Bunny than the other player. Avoid bugs, steal credit from the other player by kicking their veggies, but make sure you don't get eaten by Bunny yourself! Players can kick bugs as well as each other, and kicking a player directly into Bunny's mouth will award bonus points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features three stages, three types of bugs, eight crops to collect, six player colors to choose from, and 100 second rounds.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bunny's Bodacious Buffet Bonanza is a local two-player arcade game designed with the Steam Deck in mind. The game also supports two players on the same keyboard, a shared controller, multiple controllers, and also Remote Play Together. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005810/extras/c8f43e4e4a45541b03b17d128dc32372.avif?t=1782324932\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005810/extras_big/c8f43e4e4a45541b03b17d128dc32372.webp?t=1782324932 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The objective is simple enough for all ages: kick more veggies to Bunny than the other player. Avoid bugs, steal credit from the other player by kicking their veggies, but make sure you don't get eaten by Bunny yourself! Players can kick bugs as well as each other, and kicking a player directly into Bunny's mouth will award bonus points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features three stages, three types of bugs, eight crops to collect, six player colors to choose from, and 100 second rounds.</p>",
        "short_description": "Bunny's Bodacious Buffet Bonanza is a bite-sized competitive arcade experience for two. Watch out for bugs as you race to see who can kick the most, ripest veggies to Bunny before they go bad. The last one to kick the veggie gets the credit.",
